<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Administration | HMS</title><%@include file="../component/allcss.jsp"%></head><body><%@include file="navbar.jsp"%><main id="main-content" class="page-main"><div class="container"><h1 class="page-title">Hospital overview</h1><p>Live database aggregates, with historical appointments retained.</p><%@include file="../component/messages.jsp"%><div class="dashboard-grid">
